              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A suppression record that is stale, as grammar/suppression.md defines it, at either mechanism and in the baseline alike. The run exits with the findings code when at least one is reported. The kind is fixed on at deny: no flag, no severity setting and no per-mechanism exception reduces it below a finding, and a configuration naming this code under a severity key is an unimplemented key."
              },
